    "body": "> Now if site is an opaque origin the algorithm below will need to return failure as well.\r\n\r\nOff-topic for this PR, but I don't think we (Chrome) are currently planning to block storage in an embedded iframe merely because the top-level site has an opaque origin (i.e. as long as origin isn't opaque, the opaqueness of the site shouldn't matter).",
